<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-25376] PerfStat cannot read custom system views</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-25376</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When we add a new custom system view to &lt;em&gt;&lt;tt&gt;GridSystemViewManager&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/em&gt; and run PerfStat, other users can&apos;t open the &lt;tt&gt;prf&lt;/tt&gt; report. They see &quot;Could not find walker: &amp;lt;walker name for system view&amp;gt;&quot; because the plugin doesn&apos;t know anything about custom views&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
